[{"client_msg_id":"66d01b2c-bedd-46cb-89a1-1efb18133f11","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Windows Terminalだとちょくちょくそういう現象あったよね。最近確認してないからどうなのかわかんないけど。","ts":"1635476707.262700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N4i2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75c04721-c95c-4617-80f1-d15c945826ac","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"\u0026gt;  全部が single に統一されていれば「full-width で表示されてほしいものが half-width で表示される」ことはあってもそれ以上の不具合はでない気がします\n\u0026gt;  文字描画が崩れて編集がおかしくなる\n「①」を使っている際に編集がおかしくなる　ケースですが確かに私のターミナルの設定が統一できていなかった際に発生していた現象のようでした！いま改めてsingle幅で統一するとスリムなだけでおかしくはなりませんでした！すみません\n（以前は描画が全角だが、カーソルが当たると半角となり文字がずれて被る　など起きていました）","ts":"1635476555.261900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U06BRP8VD","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0bHu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63d5aa19-9c37-47d3-afc8-661c8c2ad5ae","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私の環境だと★とか①とかは諦めて half-width で表示されても隣の文字と被ってもなんでも来いや状態ですね","ts":"1635476318.258800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nQHc7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0acf4086-dc1c-4ed5-bd7a-48580659fd4f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"つまりまさに :sorena: 状況では?","ts":"1635476255.257200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hhB7M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b0d0039-9fe2-4cbb-aef4-067ef012da26","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"singleにすると★とか①みたいなdoubleになって欲しいものと同居できないって話かと。","ts":"1635476171.255200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vec="}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd136135-cd46-4410-9fe9-93e6cb5d62f3","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"文字描画が崩れて編集がおかしくなるというのはどういう現象を指してるのかよく分かってませんが、Vim の罫線がずれるとかそういうレベルのおかしさであれば、たぶんターミナルか tmux か、どこかの設定が single になりきってないんだと思います。\n全部が single に統一されていれば「full-width で表示されてほしいものが half-width で表示される」ことはあってもそれ以上の不具合はでない気がしますね（不具合が出たら海外の人も気づいて直すはずなので）","ts":"1635476129.254500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E57Fx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88020dbe-85fa-498f-9636-76a832e910fe","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"テキストで図を描いていると罫線こそを double にしたいことがある…","ts":"1635476120.254200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uTKC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7440734a-eaf0-420e-a673-901ba216e77e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"single でやってますが、私の用途で困ったことはあんまないですね。","ts":"1635475950.250900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cv=/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fadbc57f-7454-4a3f-a2e1-7b7bc65f0d82","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"そんなものがあるんですか！unknown functionと怒られるのでneovimには入っていないんですかね","ts":"1635475947.250700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TxXYU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ffcc0b7-80f9-40b3-9457-18eb9da033b4","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"ambiwidth=doubleのままsetcellwidthsで罫線はsingleにするというのでやってる","ts":"1635475470.249400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y54"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43778323-760f-4ddd-9353-34f30f8e780d","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"露骨に崩れなければいいのだと自分に言い聞かせて使ってる。","ts":"1635475173.248500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MUX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16b83fac-c37e-4a8f-b051-494c997fc356","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ambiwidthはクソ(n回目)","t