"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["U7JL1UKKL","U02G79NJMLY","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7iNU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d03d7267-863e-4595-a796-692f7717d739","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"罫線揃えるのを優先する人が多い印象です","ts":"1635473887.241800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+inY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63d4d20c-b74e-46ed-84b5-c4f09d1b08cc","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"そうなんですか・・なかなかもどかしいですね。\nとなると、telescopeなどの罫線を半角表示しないといけないものを使っている方は、みなさん基本的にsingle幅にしているのでしょうか？（絵文字はあきらめ・・？）","ts":"1635473866.241500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SIXK="}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf708fb5-c7c6-432f-8fb0-4dd4b9a32a81","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":":kakko-kabu-tojikakko:","ts":"1635473758.239600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zoEas"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbf91b50-f905-42ec-96ea-03efad326b23","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"アプリ、ターミナル、フォントのすべてをその意識高い状態に揃える必要があるのでかなり :nanido:","ts":"1635473755.239400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bDAq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94b879bc-935d-4657-b690-5859d955aaf1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"1グリフごとにマッピングする方法があるにはあるはず","ts":"1635473746.239100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U8Ipt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d54fe56-5d57-42dc-abf5-d4c0d3b08233","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"glyphを一つ一つ弄ればいけたりするんですかね","ts":"1635473742.238800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vg5l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ec39dc7-0e67-4d9b-96aa-1c0eeadfa4a7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"基本的にはどうしようもないですね","ts":"1635473724.238100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3gmlN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5fe4afc-1d93-4429-a3f1-b7fbba6c49f0","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"すみません、追加でambwidth=singleを使っている方にお聞きしたいのですが、\n絵文字や機種依存文字（③など）もsingle幅になってしまいませんか・・・？\n\n曖昧幅のなかでも、罫線だけ半角にしたい　などはどうしようもないのでしょうか","ts":"1635473640.237700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gPJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb12450b-4f62-45b3-93ea-721ad6393189","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"\u003c@U06ECBRTJ\u003e\nあ、いろいろ試していたら\nambwidth=singleにして\nRloginの設定で「Aタイプを半角で表示」というUnicodeのAタイプ(Ambiguous)の文字幅を半角にすることでキレイに表示されました・・！！\n\nambiguousに関して無知すぎて片方だけ設定しちゃってたから効果なかったと思ってしまっただけでした！\nありがとうございます！！","ts":"1635471270.234800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otz","count":8,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U9S4G0LJW","U02G79NJMLY","U8CC7MDCL","U72TB62UF","U7JL1UKKL","U017BU3UZBQ","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"+1::skin-tone-2","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"spJJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d61459dd-1c52-40c3-8db3-9d1ffedbedb3","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"mintty だと、どうですかね","ts":"1635470285.232200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mtb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47bfa7df-4a81-4df9-924a-6f003d532a53","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"↑Consoleの方を使うとdeviconが潰れちゃいました、、（スーファミ マリオの踏まれたクリボーみたいに","ts":"1635469136.231900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fD1U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7941a58-ef36-47e7-a800-ff0d170f5928","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"あ、Consoleとの違いはなんだろうと思ってましたが1文字ごとの視認性てきな意味ではなく表示くずれなども影響するものなんですね。\n\n試してみましたが解決はしませんでした、、ですが念の為Consoleのほうを使うようにします、ありがとうございます。","ts":"1635468526.230800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/0W4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C1DC89C0-571E-47E2-A10A-014D9A84520B","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"僕の場合はそうでした","ts":"1635466658.228400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rwc5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25773721-7671-407C-BC6C-8214F2A4183D","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"HackGenNerd Consoleにしたら直るかも？","ts":"1635466629.228100","edited":{"user":"U02AJP5L75Z","ts":"1635466733.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iNvH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d9a7203-894e-418b-9f22-836bf28a33ab","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"ambwidthはもともとdoubleでしたが、singleにしても駄目でした・・（lualineの表示が崩れただけでした・・）","ts":"1635463691.227300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BeY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37089c87-e38c-44a8-875f-6746fa14d17b","type":"message","user":"UTWEXKHLZ","text":"ちなみにfontは HackGenNerd を使ってます","ts":"1635463547.226400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jxX+"}]}]
